`/Game/MCPWeather/BP_MCPWeatherManager.RainFX` with `dry_run=true`,
`compile_blueprint=false`, and `save_blueprint=false`. It validates the source
Rain template, source-template Rain replacement load, 61-entry `User.*`
override store, no Blueprint compile/save, no dirty package addition, no
`SetAsset` mutation, and `persistent_original_write_admitted=false`. It writes
